    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d78">

                <pb facs="0183" n="75" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg75"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Thompson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-11-17"><hi rendition="#italic">November 17,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Gresham instructs Mr. Thompson to join in the request, which should be made
                    to both parties, if the floating torpedoes are proving a damage to neutral
                    vessels, that they permit the removal of those torpedoes.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
